  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "触发与版本 SSOT",
      "items": [
        "push tag v* 或 workflow_dispatch（prerelease / skip_notarize）；concurrency release-<ref> 不取消进行中发布",
        "Info.plist 为版本号唯一事实源，macOS / Windows 双 job 共享 verify-version action 强校验 tag == 版本"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "ad-hoc 发布门禁",
      "items": [
        "产物实签为 ad-hoc 即 fail（macos job 失败 → release job 永不执行），根治 secrets 漏配时的静默降级",
        "逃生门 repo variable ALLOW_ADHOC_RELEASE=true 默认拒绝、settings 可审计",
        "历史教训：v0.1.10 曾因 secrets 漏配以 ad-hoc 发布，TCC 授权升级失效复发（issue #5）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "双 asset 收敛",
      "items": [
        "release job needs [macos, windows]：下载 marker + 双 zip，校验签名态后一次 softprops/action-gh-release 挂载全部 asset",
        "Release Note 取 CHANGELOG 对应版本 + 按实签态（公证 / 自签 / ad-hoc）分支的安装指引",
        "Windows 产物无签名：SmartScreen 首次告警 + 杀软可能误报（WH_KEYBOARD_LL / SendInput）"
      ]
    }
  ]
